    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Config, not topology\nEvery recipient is described as data. Adding one is a single line in the array - the canvas does not change.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7dc35a74-927e-423b-9993-dc760d10b059",
      "name": "Sticky Note e12a8e4e",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -544,
        -176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. One generic pass\nThe loop walks the recipient list. Slicing, cleaning and writing all run through a single set of nodes.\n\nAn empty block emits a `_skip` item so the loop never stalls on zero results.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 800,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "78b6f248-c310-4f3f-bcaf-d93f9539ddd8",
      "name": "Sticky Note aca037ae",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -192,
        -208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Failures do not break the loop\nA write error is routed to an alert, then back into the loop so the next recipient is still processed.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "8a22233f-2b7b-4a2c-b358-56988fae7780",
      "name": "Sticky Note e7ffce3a",
